="0:45.558" end="0:45.781">的</span><span begin="0:45.781" end="0:46.083">那</span><span begin="0:46.083" end="0:46.591">样</span> <span begin="0:46.591" end="0:46.996">触</span><span begin="0:46.996" end="0:47.199">摸</span><span begin="0:47.199" end="0:48.467">我的灵</span><span begin="0:48.467" end="0:50.059">魂</span></p><p begin="0:50.788" end="0:58.611" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="0:50.788" end="0:51.233">每</span><span begin="0:51.233" end="0:51.749">当</span><span begin="0:51.749" end="0:52.660">我</span><span begin="0:52.660" end="0:52.981">迷</span><span begin="0:52.981" end="0:53.374">惑的</span><span begin="0:53.374" end="0:54.598">时候</span> <span begin="0:54.598" end="0:55.100">你</span><span begin="0:55.100" end="0:55.504">都</span><span begin="0:55.504" end="0:56.225">给</span><span begin="0:56.225" end="0:56.630">我</span><span begin="0:56.630" end="0:56.932">一</span><span begin="0:56.932" end="0:57.733">种温</span><span begin="0:57.733" end="0:58.611">暖</span></p><p begin="0:58.680" end="1:05.867" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v15"><span begin="0:58.680" end="0:58.968">就</span><span begin="0:58.968" end="0:59.574">像某个</span><span begin="0:59.574" end="0:59.913">人</span><span begin="0:59.913" end="1:00.137">的</span><span begin="1:00.137" end="1:00.561">手</span><span begin="1:00.561" end="1:01.264">臂</span> <span begin="1:01.264" end="1:01.671">紧</span><span begin="1:01.671" end="1:01.884">紧</span><span begin="1:01.884" end="1:02.318">搂</span><span begin="1:02.318" end="1:02.439">着</span><span begin="1:02.439" end="1:02.864">我的</span><span begin="1:02.864" end="1:03.696">肩</span><span begin="1:03.696" end="1:05.867">膀</span></p><p begin="1:09.301" end="1:16.681" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v4"><span begin="1:09.301" end="1:09.739">有</span><span begin="1:09.739" end="1:10.256">时</span><span begin="1:10.256" end="1:10.956">我</span><span begin="1:10.956" end="1:11.565">会孤独</span><span begin="1:11.565" end="1:11.966">无</span><span begin="1:11.966" end="1:12.887">助